{"id": "sfusd-proposition-28-arts-spending", "title": "SFUSD arts spending rose while other funding fell $92,577 short", "seconds": 47.5, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "1fe2c3a2b7dee0ef", "words": 134, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "San Francisco schools expanded arts instruction. Why did auditors question the funding?", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.85, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Arts", "funding"], "sub": "Additional arts funding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.76, 1.13, 1.66, 2.02, 3.44, 3.66, 3.83, 4.26, 4.62, 4.72]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The district reported serving 12,351 pupils in the first year.", "t0": 5.85, "t1": 10.11, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["Pupils served", "12,351"], ["Sites", "98"], ["Teaching positions", "44.6"]]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.21, 0.57, 1.0, 1.34, 1.7, 2.13, 2.36, 2.65, 3.08, 3.48, 3.57, 3.68, 3.96]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Under Proposition 28, the new money had to add to existing arts spending.", "t0": 10.23, "t1": 14.19, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "year", "kicker": "Additional arts funding", "text": "Additional arts funding", "mark": "Additional"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.83, 1.55, 1.71, 1.89, 2.17, 2.34, 2.44, 2.66, 2.8, 3.26, 3.5]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "For 2024, auditors began with what schools spent the year before.", "t0": 14.41, "t1": 18.85, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Prior-year spending"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.48, 1.39, 1.91, 2.34, 2.5, 2.72, 3.12, 3.39, 3.5, 3.68]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "They removed funding that was no longer available.", "t0": 18.97, "t1": 21.26, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "How the amount was calculated", "text": "Unavailable funding", "mark": "Unavailable"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.6, 1.06, 1.25, 1.38, 1.5, 1.77]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "That set the baseline for spending from other sources.", "t0": 21.38, "t1": 24.12, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Adjusted baseline"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.56, 0.69, 1.2, 1.34, 1.72, 1.9, 2.15]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Total arts spending went up.", "t0": 24.24, "t1": 25.71, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Total arts spending"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 0.51, 0.87, 1.05]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "But spending from other sources fell below the baseline.", "t0": 25.83, "t1": 28.39, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["Adjusted baseline", "$18,456,540.73"], ["Other arts funding", "$18,363,964.16"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.6, 0.8, 1.06, 1.46, 1.66, 1.9, 2.01]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The shortfall came to about $92,577.", "t0": 28.51, "t1": 32.71, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$92,576.57", "label": "The spending shortfall"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.63, 0.88, 0.99, 1.25, 1.75, 2.2, 2.47, 2.78, 3.41]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The district added reviews of how it funded teaching positions.", "t0": 32.93, "t1": 36.32, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "closure", "kicker": "The later audit closed the finding", "text": "Staff funding reviews", "mark": "Staff"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.66, 1.0, 1.39, 1.5, 1.65, 1.78, 2.12, 2.48]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "In January 2026, auditors marked the corrective action implemented.", "t0": 36.44, "t1": 41.13, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Implemented"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.7, 0.97, 2.08, 2.58, 2.81, 2.92, 3.39, 3.81]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "A state decision would show whether any money had to be repaid.", "t0": 41.25, "t1": 44.08, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "State audit resolution"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.4, 0.77, 0.92, 1.12, 1.41, 1.63, 1.91, 2.06, 2.15, 2.3]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 44.2, "t1": 46.57, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 0.94, 1.27, 1.38, 1.49, 1.76, 2.01]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Additional arts funding", "b": "How the amount was calculated", "o": "The later audit closed the finding"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "number"}